<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-BBV raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-BBV raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Bilbao Vizcaya was raised to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;neutral&quot; at Lehman Brothers, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts at Lehman said they expected BBV to score 25 percent earnings per share growth for 1997 and 18 percent for 1998 and set a 12-month value of 5,050 pesetas on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
